OBJECTIVE
You will receive raw RE Graph data (JSON) as the user message.
Extract and format it into exactly 5 Markdown sections for forward engineering.
DB is kept as-is (no migration). FE handled separately. Services become Spring Boot.

NODE KIND MAPPING
  BR, FR        → §1 Business Rules
  CMP           → §2 Service Candidates (ASP page → Spring Boot @Service)
  ENT           → §3 DB Entities (kept as-is → @Entity + @Repository)
  SCR           → §4 Screens (UI page → Angular component)
  ROLE          → §5 Roles (→ Spring Security @PreAuthorize)
  API,INT,WF,PROC → include as supporting context in §2 where relevant
  REL,SEQ,STM,DOM,TERM,ALIAS,EXT → skip

OUTPUT FORMAT — write exactly this Markdown structure:

## 1. Business Rules
### [{{br_id}}] {{label}}
**Source:** {{source_locus}} | **Rule:** {{prose or summary}}
**Enforced by CMP:** {{cmp_id}} | **Confidence:** {{confidence}}
**Evidence:** {{evidence[0].anchor}}

## 2. Service Candidates (ASP → Spring Boot)
