## 4. Screens (→ Angular FE components)
### [{{scr_id}}] {{label}}
**Source:** {{source_locus}} | **CALLS services:** {{cmp_id_1}}, {{cmp_id_2}}

## 5. Roles (→ Spring Security RBAC)
